        "@value": "A timestamped historical value for a specific field on an innovation.\n    Enables trend analysis of individual fields (readiness level trajectory,\n    adoption spread over time, geographic reach evolution) independently of\n    full record versioning. Planned for selective implementation in Phase 3\n    for priority fields: readinessLevel, adoptionLevel, estimatedUsers, adoptionCountry."
