    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The specific dimension(s) of innovativeness: what makes it\n    novel relative to existing solutions. References ATIO innovative features\n    taxonomy (built from FAO S&I Strategy innovation criteria). Multi-valued."
