      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Boolean marker on an sti_atio: ObjectProperty. When true, the\n    FieldClaim mechanism applies: values for this property from different\n    source records are preserved as sti_atio:FieldClaim nodes, and FieldSchemeUsage\n    declarations on the DataSource govern which vocabulary scheme is expected.\n    When false, the field is normalised at ingestion (e.g. country names\n    harmonised to UN M49 / FAO standard) and FieldClaim is not used."
      }
    ],
