      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Normalised at ingestion to UN M49 /\n    FAO standard country terms (ISO 3166-1 alpha-3). All source variants\n    (country names, codes, alternate spellings) are resolved to the canonical\n    FAO concept at extraction time. No FieldClaim needed."
      }
    ],
    "https://sti-portal.fao.org/ontology/sti-atio#claimEligible": [
